WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.179
O kɔ, a y'a fɔ u ye ko: "Aw ye to ka taga ni ne ye.

00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:08.605
Aw ye taga n'a ye, k'a lɔn ko ne le ye aw ta Ala ye".

00:00:08.685 --> 00:00:11.611
Mɔgɔ si t'u minɛ, mɔgɔ si tɛ u domu.

00:00:11.691 --> 00:00:15.119
Mɔgɔw b'a fɔ k'o tɛ jɛgɛ tɔw bɔɲɔgɔnko ye.

00:00:15.199 --> 00:00:21.048
U tun b'a fɔra ko u ye jii kɔrɔsibagaw ye ani ko u be se ka tɛmɛ o kan.
